# Golden characterization baselines (Phase 0 refactor safety net).
#
# The C1/C3/C4 harnesses compare these files as raw text against strings they
# build in memory with \n. With core.autocrlf=true and no attribute, git checks
# them out CRLF while the harness generates LF, so a plain branch switch is
# enough to produce a mismatch that has nothing to do with the code. Pin them to
# LF in the working tree so the comparison is byte-honest on every platform.
scripts/golden/*.json text eol=lf

# C2 compares PNG bytes; never let any filter touch them.
scripts/golden/renders/*.png binary
